<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#PartiallyMappedCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Componente de cruce para permutaciones que intercambia un segmento entre los progenitores y repara las posiciones restantes mediante la correspondencia definida por dicho segmento (PMX)."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#PartiallyMappedCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Crossover component for permutations that exchanges a segment between parents and repairs the remaining positions using the mapping defined by that segment (PMX)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#PartiallyMappedCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Componente de cruce parcialmente mapeado"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#PartiallyMappedCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Partially Mapped Crossover Component"@en .
