<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Problem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Optimization problem, formulated by its data, its decision variables, at least one objective and, optionally, constraints. A solution is an assignment of values to its decision variables."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Problem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Problema de optimización, formulado mediante sus datos, sus variables de decisión, al menos un objetivo y, opcionalmente, restricciones. Una solución es una asignación de valores a sus variables de decisión."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Problem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problem"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Problem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problema"@es .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Magnitud del problema cuyo valor se conoce antes de resolverlo y que caracteriza una instancia concreta del problema."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Problem quantity whose value is known before solving the problem and that characterizes a specific instance of it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datos del problema"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problem Data"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Constituent of the mathematical formulation of an optimization problem: its data, its decision variables, its objectives or its constraints."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Constituyente de la formulación matemática de un problema de optimización: sus datos, sus variables de decisión, sus objetivos o sus restricciones."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Elemento del problema"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problem Element"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Magnitud, o colección indexada de magnitudes, que interviene en la formulación del problema y se representa mediante un símbolo en sus expresiones. Su valor se conoce de antemano (datos) o se busca al resolver el problema (variable de decisión). No se refiere a una magnitud física."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Quantity, or indexed collection of quantities, that takes part in the formulation of the problem and is represented by a symbol in its expressions. Its value is either known in advance (data) or sought when solving the problem (decision variable). It does not refer to a physical quantity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Magnitud del problema"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Problem Quantity"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
