<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Componente de cruce que decide aleatoriamente, para cada posición, de qué progenitor hereda el valor el descendiente."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Crossover component that decides randomly, for each position, from which parent the offspring inherits the value."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Componente de cruce por decisión aleatoria"@es .
